        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Juan Carlos Onetti Borges, Richard Llewellyn\n- Roles: novelist, short story author\n- Places: Montevideo, Madrid, Uruguay, Britain\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Dafydd Vivian Llewellyn Lloyd was born on 8 December 1906 and was known by the pen name Richard Llewellyn.\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges was born on July 1, 1909, in Montevideo.\n- Richard Llewellyn was a British novelist.\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges was an Uruguayan novelist and author of short stories.\n- Richard Llewellyn died on 30 November 1983.\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges died on May 30, 1994, in Madrid.",
